  "description": "LLMBridge is a unified .NET SDK that enables developers to interact with OpenAI, Azure OpenAI, Google Gemini, Anthropic Claude, and future LLM providers through a single, consistent API.\n\nKey Features:\n\n• Unified provider abstraction\n• OpenAI support\n• Azure OpenAI support\n• Google Gemini support\n• Anthropic Claude support\n• Common request and response models\n• Token usage tracking\n• Async-first architecture\n• Vendor lock-in reduction\n• .NET 8+ compatible\n\nSwitch providers without changing your application code.\n\nBuild AI applications faster with one SDK and multiple LLM providers.",
  "iconFile": "llmbridgeicon.png",
  "id": "LLMBridge",
